{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter's New Job", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "A Crazy First Day", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Starting a Conversation With Someone You Know", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Remember in English, there are certain expressions and words you use to greet and start a conversation with someone you know. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Review the charts below. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Saying <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Hello</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Follow-up\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>Hi!</li> <li>Hello!</li> <li>Hey!</li> <li>Hiya!</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>It's   <span class=\\\"strong\\\">great</span>/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">nice</span>/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">good</span>   to see you</li>  <li>It's been <span class=\\\"strong\\\">ages/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">a while</span>.</li>  <li>You look <span class=\\\"strong\\\">well/<span class=\\\"strong\\\">good</span>!</li></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responses\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Questions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Responses\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>And you!</li> <li>You too!</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>How are you doing?</li> <li>How are things?</li></ul></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><ul><li>Good, thanks.</li> <li>Very well, thanks.</li> <li>Not too bad, thanks.</li></ul></span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Asking for Clarification", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Remember when you don't understand what was said, or something was not clear to you, it is  important to express your lack of understanding and seek clarification from the person you are talking to. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Expressing lack of understanding\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Asking for clarification\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>Sorry, I am not sure I am following you.</li>  <li>I beg your pardon, but I don't quite understand. </li> <li>I'm not sure I know what you mean.</li> <li>I'm not sure I follow you.</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <ul><li>Could you elaborate on that? </li> <li>Could you be more specific?</li> <li>Could you repeat that, please? </li> <li>Could you clarify that, please?</li> <li>Do you mean ... ? </li> <li>What do you mean?</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "multinational", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in many different countries ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: They are a multinational company. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are the words to review. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "agency ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a business that provides a particular service for people or organizations", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I work for a PR agency.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be responsible for ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be in charge of ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The agency is responsible for a number of different things. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "publicity", "type": "name"}, {"content": "attention in magazines, newspapers, or television", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I help create publicity for their new clothing line.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "public image", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the ideas and opinions that the public has about a person or an organization ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Our clients want to improve their public image.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "CEO", "type": "name"}, {"content": "short for Chief Executive Officer, the person with the most authority in a large company ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I work with Janet. She is the CEO of Polygon.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob11aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to work closely with ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to work together with another person", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I work closely with members of the advertising team. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to play a role ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to have an influence on something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Do you play a role in all their projects?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le04ob11aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Imagine you run into one of your old friends. Write a dialogue about the conversation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Remember to use expressions to start  a conversation with someone you know. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask about their job and the work they do.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask for clarification in the conversation. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Proofread your dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice reading your dialogue aloud. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I start a conversation with someone I know. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for clarification in a conversation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about jobs and work.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn6le04ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn6le04ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le04ob11re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter's Mom</span>: Hello, Peter. You look good. How are you doing? I'm glad you still remember you have a mother. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Hi, mom. It's been a while. How are things on your end? I've been really busy. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter's Mom</span>: Not too bad. What do you mean busy? You're never busy.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Ha ha. Very funny. I don't know if I mentioned, but I got the job. I am now working for that multinational PR agency."}, {"image": "engenn6le04ob11re2img06.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "27500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter's Mom</span>: Congrats! I'm not sure I know what you mean though. Could you elaborate on that?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It's a public relations and social media company. They're responsible for publicity and public image.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter's Mom</span>: Sorry, Peter. You're breaking up. My reception is really bad. I don't quite understand what you're saying. Could you repeat that? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Basically, I'm Janet's, who is the CEO, personal assistant and work closely with the head of fashion and media."}, {"image": "engenn6le04ob11re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "57500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter's Mom</span>: Do you mean you play a role in the projects? More importantly, are you eating well?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes, mom! This new job is really demanding. I've been working long hours and haven't had much time to socialize at all.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter's Mom</span>: I know what you mean, Peter. Just take good care of yourself and don't work too hard. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Thanks, mom. I won't."}], "coverimg": "engenn6le04ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for clarification. ", "type": "Learning Outcome